/*
  ClientUtilitiesSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0003 · ClientUtilitiesSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ClientUtilitiesSection` resolves (table "ClientUtilitiesSection") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first two groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/devtools/ClientUtilitiesSection.tsx): the 15 tool
  name/description keys passed to `useToolList` (the web renders the key text
  itself, since these keys are absent from the en catalog) and the section copy
  (search prompt + no-results). The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness banners, loading / error / catalog-empty copy, accessibility).
*/

